Steps to Mirror System Disk
---------------------------------
1. After disk is installed either reboot or MAKEDEV to see rz device.
2. disklabel device with default label
    disklabel -rw /dev/rrz0c rz29
3. Duplicate label from existing root volume to new volume with all fstype
as unused.
4. Then follow LSM manual chapter 5.3 to mirror boot disk (this assumes you
have encapsulated the root volume, if not, follow section 5.2).

Bruce



