Well, not on the Alpha, you can't.

You *may* be able to run statically linked DU binaries.  This is very
infrequently tested, at best, and static DU binaries are few and far
between, at best.

You can definitely not yet run Linux binaries on the Alpha.  It's in the
pipeline, but it's certainly not there yet.  The lack of consistency
in the Linux system call interface on different architectures essentially
means that you have to write most of a whole new emulation for each
platform.

