Paul Coen wrote:

> I'm trying to hack the INN 1.7.2 nnrpd program to use the sia* calls
> for user authentication.  Am I reading the (dripping sarcasm) wonderfully
> thorough documentation correctly, and I have to use sia_ses_init, and
