casing (might be different... Been awhile since I ordered a new drive)?
I have several of these disks (RZ28-VW and RZ29-VA) and have swapped
them out numerous times without powering/shutting down the system. As
long as you are using them in conjunction with the proper drive shelf
(either a StorageWorks or builtin) they should do just fine. At worst,
after removing a disk I let it sit for at least a minute before placing
it back in the shelf (those things get HOT!).

